          {
            "title": "Example: Variables",
            "id": 126814,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gunakan variabel yang menyimpan hasil perbandingan sebagai kondisi pernyataan if.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" multiPlayer = players &gt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" multiPlayer {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Set names and choose your characters&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"players\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"players &gt; 1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Set names and choose your characters&#xA;\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>multiPlayer</code>.</p></body></html>"
