          {
            "title": "Question: Else",
            "id": 126815,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa sebutan untuk bagian dari pernyataan <code>if</code> / <code>else</code> yang dijalankan ketika kondisi pernyataan <code>if</code> bernilai <code>false</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Pernyataan <code>else</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada kondisional seperti itu</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Pernyataan <code>if</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pernyataan <code>else</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Else",
            "id": 126816,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat pernyataan <code>if</code> kosong (tidak memiliki blok kode) yang memeriksa apakah <code>membership</code> sama dengan <code>\"gold\"</code>, diikuti pernyataan <code>else</code> kosong.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" membership = \" /><text value=\"&quot;gold&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" membership == \" /><text value=\"&quot;gold&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else membership != &quot;gold&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>if</code>, diikuti oleh <code>membership == \"gold\"</code>, lalu <code>}</code>, <code>else</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
